```modelica
block StateA
  output Integer status;
equation
  status = ticksInState();
end StateA;
block StateB
end StateB;
model Study
  StateA a;
  StateB b;
  Real ct;
  Integer result;
equation
  ct = sample(time, Clock(1, 1));
  initialState(a);
  transition(a, b, ct > 100, reset = false);
  result = a.status;
end Study;
```

Under Modelica 3.7, is model Study legal? If legal, give the exact value of Study.result immediately after the third clock activation at t = 2 s. Return exactly `LEGAL; <integer>` or `ILLEGAL`.
